          "label": "Literal source wording",
          "statement": "The experimental paragraph prints an orientation of 90°C relative to excitation and detection paths.",
          "locator": "Main PDF p.2, optical methods"
        }
      ],
      "handling": "Retain this as an unresolved unit transcription in a geometry sentence. Do not turn it into a 90 °C measurement temperature; PL/PLE are explicitly measured at room temperature."
    }
  ],
  "remaining_gaps": [
    "Complete supplied six-page main only; SI and cited full sources remain unreviewed.",
    "Physical batch IDs and exact aliquot crosswalks are not supplied. NC and SMP are the source preparation/characterization labels.",
    "TEM and SEM sizes are reported, but no TEM/SEM panels are supplied in this main. Particle shape, coating thickness and atomic coordinates are not measured here.",
    "Particle radius, crystallite size, lattice distortion and EPR site parameters have distinct measurement bases. No diameter is calculated from a radius.",
    "Crystal-cell/molecular/particle illustrations remain presentation pending where separately verified assets are absent.",
    "Precipitation temperatures/atmosphere, addition rates, stirring speeds, centrifugation duration/rotor radius, drying atmosphere/pressure and polymerization conversion are unreported.",
    "PAA thickness, mass fraction and coating completeness are unmeasured; the authors discuss imperfect coating as a possibility."
  ],
